# netopt-waf exclusions that run AFTER the OWASP Core Rule Set.
#
# Copy to after-crs.conf (setup.sh does this) and restart netopt-waf.
# Use configure-time exclusions here: they remove or narrow a rule everywhere.
#
# Remove one rule for every request:
# SecRuleRemoveById 920350
#
# Stop one rule from inspecting a single argument:
# SecRuleUpdateTargetById 942100 "!ARGS:query"
